  "views": {
    "hero": "three_quarter",
    "reads": {
      "front": "From behind the caster the wall rises up in front of them, fills the frame and rolls away toward the target, its crest curling forward; the crash throws spray high above the target.",
      "side": "The clearest view of the shape: a gentle back slope, a hollow front face and a curling lip that rolls left to right, then throws forward and collapses over the target in a tall crown of spray.",
      "top": "A wide band of water with a white foam line on its crest sweeps across the ground from the caster to the target. The pool at the caster, the ripples and the big puddle spreading after the crash tell the story once the wall is gone.",
      "three_quarter": "Hero view. The wall reads as a wide, curling wave rolling diagonally away, tall enough to swallow the target; the crash, foam cloud and soaked ground land in full view."
    }
